  "stagedNote": "STAGED, not ingested. planStagedDirectory (backend/scripts/ingest-checklist-csv-to-catalog.cjs's real, read-only, no-Cosmos planner) PASSES on this file: verdict 'pass', 3,089 batch rows, 3,089 distinct ids, 0 collisions, 0 duplicatesFolded, 0 unregistered keys. setKey upper-deck-extended-series was already registered in productSetKeys.ts (D39, 2026-08-31 ruling) before this package existed -- the gap was that no checklist rows had ever been staged under it, not a missing key. No new productSetKeys registrations were needed for this package. Every genuinely independent named insert (Black Diamond Dominance, Champs Rookies, Clear Dominance, Day with the Cup, Dazzlers Blue, Holo GrFx, HoloGrFx Future Fame, Smooth Grooves, UD Canvas, 1997 Collectors Choice Commemorative, 1997-98 SPx Retro, 1999-00 Upper Deck Retro History Class, 2006-07 Black Diamond Retro, 2007-08 Upper Deck Retro) carries its OWN card-number range with zero overlap against Base Set's #501-700 -- these are 'own-cards' by inspection, no rung to fold.",
  "r67SubsetParallelFold": {
